<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Waste Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Waste Industries started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Mari Bari initiated coverage of Waste Industries Inc with an accumulate rating and a 12-month price target of $20.</p>
<p>-- the stock closed Tuesday at 18.</p>
</text>
